'''Dempsy''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found near the [[Snowhill Post Office]] located in [[Snowhill]]. He sells [[Brawler]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Catchweight Brawler Shoulderpads]]
*[[Catchweight Brawler Pants]]
*[[Catchweight Brawler Helmet]]
*[[Catchweight Brawler Gloves]]
*[[Catchweight Brawler Boots]]
*[[Catchweight Brawler Jacket]]
*[[Brawler's Flair Shard of Fire]]
*[[Brawler's Power Shard of Vitality III]]
*[[Brawler's Necklace of Vitality III]]
*[[Brawler's Ring of Regeneration III]]
*[[Brawler's Anvil Hammer of Cheapshot]]
*[[Brawler's Anvil Hammer of Pummeling]]
*[[Brawler's Anvil Hammer of Rumbling]]

==Trivia==
*Dempsy was introduced in-game on the update of August 6, 2013.
